<content class="appendix">

    <para id="atomic-masses-reading-table">This table lists selected isotopes. Numbers in parentheses give uncertainties in the last quoted digits; for example, 3.52(18) means 3.52 ± 0.18. Abundance ranges show natural variation. See the <link target-id="atomic-masses-data-sources">table notes</link> for sources, decay-mode conventions, and metastable-state assignments.</para>
